gives rob in greater reach and  coverage she becomes a bigger target  too including to maria's poison tipped  spider legs  maria uses webs to trap all of robin's  giant arms  leaving the beautiful giant robin wide  open for an attack  we get an interesting moment where maria  puts on brass knuckles and says she's a  martial artist at heart  not something i expected from someone  who often uses a weapon and has  all those spider tricks up her sleeves  but an interesting development  nonetheless  she just jumps in there and starts  beating on giant robin  saying there's no need to hold back  since they are both women  you can tell she's really enjoying  herself here and again it's shown how in  one piece female characters can be just  as ruthless and skilled in fighting as  male characters  this is nothing new for one piece since  we have a female yonko  after all but still it's notable maria  even calls the giant robin  a satisfyingly large punching bag and  you see robin's human body in pain from  all the hits  this is no downplayed fight and i really  appreciate that it might even be my  favorite flying six fight  yet which is saying a lot the tables  have clearly turned though and  robin de-blooms her giant body while  maria comments on how she's now the one  trying to get away  robin tries to grab her or hit her with  some giant arms but maria skillfully  blocks them and traps them with her  spider webs  not only that though she then reveals  that the webs are flammable and lights  them on fire from the looks of it maria  has the clear advantage right now  and as people do when they get  overconfident and think they're gonna  win  she starts trash talking she starts  talking about how robin said it would be  over quickly  and now she's losing she talks about  what a disgrace sanji is again  and says that this defeat proves what a  hopeless pair they are  i'm sure sanji would love to hear that  he's being paired up with robin here but  the point is  one last time maria is emphasizing all  of robin's potential insecurities  robin is now trapped by webs and the  fire is everywhere to a large extent  preventing new limbs from blooming  because they would just burn up and hurt  robin maria  asks why the giant skeleton yokai a  fitting description for  brooke in wano doesn't help her but  again brooke just laughs it off calling  her moronic  all the straw hats don't see robin as a  damsel in distress in need of saving  and that's not because they don't care  about her as maria keeps emphasizing but  because they trust and rely on her and  they don't want to disrespect her by not  trusting in her abilities  maria keeps hitting robin saying what is  the devil child gonna do  now she's helpless dead weight for her  crew and they only value her mind so she  doesn't even need her limbs  since no one needs her help and there's  the big thing people feel good when  they're needed by others and to robin  someone who has struggled to feel worthy  and find meaning in life  sanji and brook trusting in her to help  them  is the greatest gift that's what anakima  is relying on each other and knowing you  can't do everything on your own  luffy is not a super saiyan god ultimate  without his crew and friends he would  have lost most of his battles in one  piece  another interesting thing is that maria  says they only value her mind which in  and of itself to me  is not a huge insult even if robin  wasn't a fighter she'd still be an asset  because of her knowledge  and that's not really an insult in and  of itself of course beyond that she's  also a terrific fighter and obviously  the crew doesn't just view her as a  brain  just as they don't just view zorro as a  sword they view her as family  as an irreplaceable part of their nakama  we then get a flashback of robin with  the revolutionaries and this seems like  a good time to plug my most recent one  piece video about monkey d  dragon his commanders and their powers  explained link to that is in the  description definitely check it out when  you finish this video but for the  purpose of this chapter  the revolutionaries are teaching her not  to just slap but how to do a powerful  palm strike  i kind of wish she became an expert in  dragon claw fists like  sabo but at least she does agree to  learn the fishman karate palm thing as  she calls it i love seeing koala and  sabo so happy when she agrees to learn  it and it's definitely a good thing she  did  she already used it in the past to help  the crew as we see her using it from the  ship  sabo explains that she's gotta hone in  on the opponent's core  and that this move will be her trump  card she ends up using the secret  fishman karate move with a giant arm and  maria thinks she missed but  no actually she took down the ceiling  stopping the fire  i love those next level chest like moves  and then we see  something truly crazy and epic robin  looking very fine adopts the look of a  devil  in this form called demonial fleur  she says she'll be the devil if that's  what it takes to help the people  counting on her  such an epic moment and i love seeing  black maria horrified  at the sight of r straw hat clearly  maria has become the prey here  robin even brings back what maria was  saying to her  that this time maria shouldn't have  limbs and then in this amazing panel  she uses her new form in advanced  dislocation techniques to completely  wreck black maria i cannot wipe the  smile off my  face this was such an amazing moment i  love the look  i love the vampire teeth and wings  robin's got going on here and it's  significant that she's not calling  herself  a devil child but a devil as if she's  fully grown  and become a full-fledged devil one that  obviously you don't want to mess with  what a moment for robin it's one of my  favorite moments of hers not only  because she beats a flying six member  but because of the progression of her  character arc  and the form and the great dialogue  taking place and it's official  i can't decide between robin and nami i  feel like i alternate every single time  between which one i like more depending  on who gets the most recent epic moment  i'll just have to accept that i can't  choose between these two  gorgeous girls so after that glorious  battle the maria underlings can't enter  because the ice walls that brook created  and as they peek between the walls to  see maria defeated and robin looking  like a demon  brook takes advantage of the fact that  they are all lined up and hits them with  an  orchestra finishing the force off we see  robin saying she overdid it a bit and  falling down as brook comes in  saying easy there robin a very  heartwarming moment and  wow robin could not have been cooler in  that fight she gets mvp for this chapter  for sure we then get caribou who is  using his swamp powers to take out a  month's worth of food  on an attempt to get luffy back to 100  and luffy is looking better really going  to town on the food  we get a hilarious moment where they're  asking if luffy can explain the  situation  and he speaks as he's eating and all  that comes across  is traff munch munch choo choo whoop  kaido and that's pretty much it it's  absolutely hilarious  and then perhaps the most interesting  thing this chapter  happens which is a big statement after  robin's amazing performance  but i think it is warranted momo and  shinobu are talking shinobu is  overprotective but momo insists that  they must do  all they can and specifically he must do  all he can to defend the capital  and stop it from being destroyed in  order to do that not only does momo have  to go back  he wants shinobu to use her ripe ripe  fruit to turn him into an  adult he'll still have the mind and  heart of a child  and he'll never be able to return to  normal but momo doesn't care he needs  access to a more powerful version of  himself  and the more powerful dragon that it  would result in  we're told on the side of the final  panel that momo is showing such  unwavering resolve he's crying but  determined to do  anything he can to help his country a  true leader worthy of being the son of  odin this  is an amazing turning point and if it  wasn't for robin's epicness this chapter  i'd give the mvp to momo for his resolve  alone  this is gonna be crazy now that it's  been mentioned it's pretty much  guaranteed to happen and since momo has  a clone of quite possibly the strongest  fruit  he'll be insanely useful once he becomes  an adult although i'm not saying this  will happen shinobu can  in theory use the fruit on luffy if  needed to give him a power boost too  the possibilities here are really  endless and i can't wait to see momo  become the legend he's so clearly meant  to be  but wow guys what insanity what epicness  what all-around mind-blowing moments and  reveals one piece is fire  and that's nothing new but i always  gotta make it clear just how good it is  in my humble opinion 1021 chapters in  and i'm still on the edge of my seat  looking forward to the next chapter  as usual let me know your thoughts on  this one what you're looking forward to  happening next the most and let me know  who your mvp was this round the very  attractive robin  the cool brook the swamp fridge caribou  or  the resolve dragon momo plenty of  choices to choose from even that one guy  who talks a lot this chapter while he's  eating so no one understands him  but yeah if you did enjoy this review  and want to keep them coming  the best thing you could do is channel  the pirate king within and smash  that like button until it changes colors  sometimes it changes to black  white blue whatever it is smash that  thing if you haven't make this the video  you subscribe and hit that notification  bell to turn on all notifications or you  will miss future one piece videos that's  just the way it works and if you are new  to the space fan let me know by saying  hi  in the comments so glad to have you  aboard lastl